### Lab 7 API tests. Set @baseUrl to your API_URL (no slash at the end),
### then click "Send Request" above each test (VS Code REST Client).
@baseUrl = http://PASTE-YOUR-API-ID.execute-api.localhost.floci.io:4566

### T1: health -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### T2: create a valid issue -> 201 and a new id
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/issues
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Login page shows a blank screen",
  "description": "Created through API Gateway in Lab 7",
  "priority": "High"
}

### T3: invalid issue -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/issues
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hi",
  "description": "Too short and wrong priority",
  "priority": "Critical"
}

### T4: no DELETE route -> 404 {"message":"Not Found"} from API Gateway
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/issues/ISS-101

### T5: CORS preflight from our website -> Access-Control-Allow-Origin: http://localhost:4566
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/api/issues
Origin: http://localhost:4566
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: content-type

### T6: CORS preflight from another site -> NO Access-Control-Allow-Origin header
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/api/issues
Origin: http://evil.example
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: content-type
